---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import brain from '../../assets/illustrations/brain.png';
---

<section class="bg-brown py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[3fr_2fr] lg:gap-16"
  >
    <div>
      <h2
        class="font-display text-4xl font-black uppercase leading-tight text-cream-light sm:text-5xl"
      >
        The Cognitive Hijack
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg text-cream-light">
        By opening your phone right when waking up, you are handing the keys to
        your focus to algorithms designed to trigger stress, not productivity.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-8 text-amber">
        → Over 84% of people check their phone within 10 minutes of waking up.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-amber/80">
        2026 Cell Phone Usage Stats, Reviews.org
      </p>
    </div>

    <Image
      src={brain}
      alt="Illustration of a bandaged brain leaning on crutches"
      class="mx-auto w-40 max-lg:order-first"
    />
  </div>
</section>
